@startuml
actor Student
participant BookingService
participant BookingRepository
Student -> BookingService : requestBooking(roomId, startTime, endTime)
BookingService -> BookingService : validate time range (R1: future start, 0 < duration <= 2h)
BookingService -> BookingRepository : check room blocked status (R3)
BookingRepository --> BookingService : room status
BookingService -> BookingRepository : check active booking overlap (R2)
BookingRepository --> BookingService : availability result
alt created - all validations pass
  BookingService -> BookingRepository : create and save booking
  BookingRepository --> BookingService : booking persisted
  BookingService --> Student : return confirmation (R4)
else unavailable - invalid time, blocked room, or overlap
  BookingService --> Student : reject request with reason
end
note over BookingService, BookingRepository
  Assumption: touching intervals are allowed; blocked rooms retain existing bookings.
end note
@enduml
